          "comment": "[Playbook] We added a standard insurance covenant: the Agreement has no programme-level coverage requirement even though MSL holds IBM inventory and tooling, works with IBM premises and accesses IBM systems and data. Limits are our standard position (CGL USD 1M/2M, E&O USD 2M, cyber USD 5M where MSL processes IBM or IBM customer data); we can work with E&O USD 1M and cyber USD 2M if needed.",
