              "numbering": "16.22",
              "asHeading": false,
              "text": "16.22 Insurance\n\nMSL shall maintain, at its own expense, throughout the term of this Agreement and for one (1) year thereafter: commercial general liability insurance of not less than USD 1,000,000 per occurrence and USD 2,000,000 in the aggregate; professional liability (errors and omissions) insurance of not less than USD 2,000,000; workers' compensation insurance as required by applicable law; and, where MSL processes IBM or IBM customer data, cyber liability insurance of not less than USD 5,000,000. MSL shall provide certificates of insurance to IBM upon request. This Section is in addition to, and does not limit, any insurance obligation of MSL elsewhere in this Agreement or its Attachments."
